Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.73,0:02:04.28,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe long battle that divided Skypiea\Nfor 400 years has finally ended.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.28,0:02:08.48,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Where there was once was war,\Nthere is now a joyous celebration.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER A]\NNo. No thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.11,0:02:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't drink any more.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.03,0:02:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGreat! There they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.00,0:02:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go wake everyone up! Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.17,0:02:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shh! 'Cause we're gonna\Nsteal the gold and run!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.39,0:02:39.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's gold? Where?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.67,0:02:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Quiet, loudmouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.47,0:02:43.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Loudmouth," huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a whole lot\Nlouder than me, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! Just listen to yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.38,0:02:49.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what you are, Nami? Loud!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! You're calling me loud?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve, you hypocrite!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.13,0:02:54.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're super loud!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.68,0:02:55.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.68,0:02:57.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you're super mega ultra-loud!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why you're yelling!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.10,0:03:03.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI]\NThe only reason I'm yelling is so you can\Nhear me over your incredibly loud voice!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you two shut up?\NI'm trying to sleep over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NUsopp, why did you hit me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI'm a lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And ladies don't just yell with\Ntheir mouths wide open, now, do they?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWell, your mouth's wide open right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.09,0:03:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, NAMI, USOPP, CHOPPER arguing]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Boy, those Blue Sea people
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sure do like to party, don't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After four days of this,\Nyou think they'd be worn out.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.63,0:03:30.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can be human.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.78,0:03:34.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So then that's the plan, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Think he's right, gang!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's not every day we get\Nto go to an island in the sky,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.81,0:03:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR J panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.98,0:03:45.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}so let's make this trip worthwhile!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.49,0:03:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.94,0:03:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chief! We found it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have just found the golden bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN gasps]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.49,0:04:00.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. I-It's hanging off Giant Jack,\Nbut I don't know for how long.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're trying to pull it up right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need every able-bodied\Nwarrior at the western shore now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.83,0:04:05.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR K]\NLet's go! Gather the tribe!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR L]\NTo the western shore!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThe belfry.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR O]\NOne more time!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.41,0:04:38.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR P]\NOne... Two...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIORS grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.62,0:04:42.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR O]\NHeave!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.54,0:04:46.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIORS grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.76,0:05:01.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We still need more people!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BRAHAM]\NIt's the pride of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't lose it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COWBOY HAT]\NWe won't!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.27,0:05:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR O]\NGive it everything you've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIORS grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.21,0:05:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You call this a "rubber band"?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and here's a little inside\Ninformation about 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.67,0:06:02.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those babies are the primary\Nthings that took down Giant Jack!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[RUBBER BAND NUT]\NMy word!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.13,0:06:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm the only one in\Nthe world who has them!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.02,0:06:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more!\NNamely... Heh heh!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This piece of metal!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gather 'round, folks,\Nand take a gander!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary\Npiece of metal, nosiree!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It came from our valiant vessel,\Nthe Going Merry!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.49,0:06:27.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's withstood the Grand Line and\NEneru's attacks with barely a scratch!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.37,0:06:30.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This here's the "King of Metal Sheets!"
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And just think: it can all be yours!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How 'bout it? Wanna trade some\Nof your dials for this?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.83,0:06:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, not really, but I'll gladly\Ntrade you for this rubber band!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So will I! Got more?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Me, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.14,0:06:42.22,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER D]\NI want three!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.14,0:06:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWater.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.81,0:07:00.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOh, I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ZORO]\NYou sure are in a good mood, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm assuming your trading went well?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.75,0:07:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! And how!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.78,0:07:13.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just look at all the dials I got!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.10,0:07:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One little press... And voila!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.91,0:07:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, good for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYa mean great!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can do so many things with 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.80,0:07:27.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ole Usopp workshop's gonna\Nbe totally revolutionized!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.34,0:07:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could use one to store\Nsmells in your swords!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.72,0:07:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That way you'll smell fresh-cut\Nmelons every time you practice!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.07,0:07:36.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Sound good?\N– No thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.65,0:07:37.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOh!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.82,0:07:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Speaking of weapons, I'm gonna use these\Nto make Nami's Clima-Tact stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention my slingshot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.29,0:07:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo, where's everybody else, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.08,0:07:56.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others are still inside,\Nand Robin went off by herself.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.79,0:07:59.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAKE snoring]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.71,0:08:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe snake's still conked out, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must be really tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.40,0:08:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou'd be, too, if you\Ndanced for four days straight.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he was so happy about...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope they come out soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.23,0:08:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he wakes up, I don't\Nknow how friendly he'll be.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.61,0:08:15.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHuh? Who?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This well-mannered snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say. You didn't\Nsee him when he was mad.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.95,0:08:22.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWho? This well-mannered snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLike I said, you didn't see him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just wait till he tries to eat you.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll see what a pain he can be.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWho? This well-mannered snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.75,0:08:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWho? This well-mannered snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fooled ya with a tone dial!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop being so stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.84,0:08:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NMe? Stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're the one\Nwho got fooled! Ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.61,0:08:45.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.65,0:08:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I thought Luffy ate too much!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAre we there yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThere! I told ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! Is it...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.47,0:08:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, the real deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.60,0:08:58.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just like the ones the\Nbig monkeys showed us!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.73,0:09:01.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSee? See? See?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's so much stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.98,0:09:05.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's all ours!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, that's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER E]\NAmazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER F]\NIt's beautiful.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER G]\NI didn't expect it to be so big!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER H]\NIt's magnificent!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.59,0:09:25.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR O]\NOh, but look, one of\Nthe side columns is broken off.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.90,0:09:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER I]\NYeah. What a shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.69,0:09:32.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there! Under the bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.32,0:09:34.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR P]\NThat thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's the stone our ancestors\Ngave their lives to protect?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WARRIOR Q]\NChief, the words\Nthat are inscribed on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do they say?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an ancient text.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impossible to read.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"We shall know the true meaning\Nand utter it to no one."
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.77,0:09:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"It's our legacy to\Nbe the inheritors of history,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and our duty to protect it with\Nthe sounding of the grand belfry."
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN]\NTh-Those words!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.51,0:10:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you know them?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThey were inscribed on\Na wall in the ruins of Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.76,0:10:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Generations ago, your people were\Nentrusted to be its guardians, correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.19,0:10:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can actually read\Nthose ancient characters?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.15,0:10:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIt mentions Poseidon,\Nan ancient weapon named after a god.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It even gives its whereabouts.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.58,0:10:34.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER J]\NAre you certain?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.50,0:10:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDERS whispering]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancient weapon?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why would it say\Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.84,0:10:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER L]\NHow odd.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.05,0:10:41.95,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER M]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.95,0:10:43.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NAnother weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.15,0:10:46.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,One different from Pluton of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.49,0:10:50.49,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NAnd to think there are\Ndangerous things like this
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.49,0:10:51.19,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,out there in
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just another dead end.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.36,0:10:59.24,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't what I was looking\Nfor or what I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.51,0:11:01.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, Miss?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.09,0:11:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that stuff engraved on the\Nside part of the Poneglyph, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.86,0:11:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NGol D. Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN gasps]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.11,0:11:19.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GOL D. ROGER]\NI made it here,\Nand I will guide this passage
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,all the way to the farthest\Nends of the earth.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The stormiest seas will not stop me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirate Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Pirate King?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.54,0:11:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then this could only mean that\Nhe came to the sky islands!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.93,0:11:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And more importantly, how was he able\Nto understand and use this ancient language?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.61,0:11:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it says "Roger," does it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.15,0:11:45.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYou know him?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NAh, yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.41,0:11:48.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Blue Sea pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.03,0:11:51.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I met him when he came to this\Nland over 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.93,0:11:54.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I take it that his name\Nis inscribed there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYes.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.02,0:12:01.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Honestly, I have no idea how he managed\Nto reach this bell, but somehow he did.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this inscription is\Nproof that he was here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.67,0:12:04.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.63,0:12:11.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, there\Nare two kinds of Poneglyph stones:
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.56,0:12:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}ones that contain information, and others\Nthat tell how to reach other Poneglyphs
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.85,0:12:17.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,scattered throughout the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.52,0:12:21.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This stone obviously has information.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.69,0:12:26.19,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,"I made it here, and I\Nwill guide this passage
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.19,0:12:28.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,all the way to the farthest\Nends of the earth."
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.45,0:12:33.24,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Guide this passage.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.78,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Guide.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could he...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could he mean the Rio Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.28,0:12:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief. This Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its duty has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.94,0:12:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN]\NIts duty?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. I have a hunch\Nabout these Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}As I said, there are certain ones spread\Nacross the world that contain information.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By reading them as one,\NI believe they'll form
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.58,0:13:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a passage that will reveal the true\Nhistory of the Blank Century.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.73,0:13:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}In other words, the passage completed\Nby connecting them is what will make up
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a legendary final Poneglyph\Nthat's yet to be discovered.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Rio Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.21,0:13:25.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gol D. Roger must have taken the text\Nfrom the Poneglyph here to the island
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where the Rio Poneglyph\Nmay very well be located.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must have...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.09,0:13:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we... don't\Nhave to fight any longer?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[crying]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.59,0:13:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then our ancestors'\Nwish has been fulfilled?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.89,0:13:52.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[crying]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [FAT VEST] Chief!\N– [FRINGED SHOULDERS] Hang on!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.89,0:13:55.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZIPPERED COLLAR]\NAre you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.31,0:13:59.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN]\NThank goodness!\NOur war is finally over!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NWell, I'd better\Nget to fulfilling my duty.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.59,0:14:10.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Like Roger before me, I have to guide this\Npassage, and the other ones I've read,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.90,0:14:14.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,all the way to the end of the Grand\NLine, to the island of Raftel.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.93,0:14:17.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NWell, then. Where were we?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.31,0:14:24.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I was about to tell you how much your\Nfriend in the straw hat reminds me of Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.81,0:14:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That boy is... interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.77,0:14:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name's Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.27,0:14:32.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I find him interesting as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.53,0:14:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D? So the lad even shares the\Nsame middle initial as Roger?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.17,0:14:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure there's got to be some\Nhistorical significance to that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.50,0:14:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Miss.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.85,0:14:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I recall you and your friends\Nsaying that you sought gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And didn't you say it was more\Nvaluable than Vearth on the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.49,0:14:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CHIEFTAIN]\NWe obviously can't offer you the belfry,\Nbut how about the broken support?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.35,0:15:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PONYTAIL]\NThat's a great idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.53,0:15:02.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to give something\Nto our heroes,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that's a perfect token\Nof our appreciation!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.81,0:15:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER N]\NPlease take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER O]\NWe insist!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.46,0:15:10.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks!\NBut are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHIEFTAIN]\NUh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.17,0:15:14.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER P]\NAll right, everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.67,0:15:17.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's bring this gift to our\Nfriends from the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.80,0:15:19.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER Q]\NIf we wrap it up,\Nit'll be easier to carry!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER R]\NIt's gonna take\Nevery one of us to move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ISLANDER S]\NYeah, you're not kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't wait too long.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[stomach growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.69,0:15:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.53,0:15:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[stomach growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.82,0:15:41.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThere's not a soul in site.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.53,0:15:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've gotta admit, this is pretty weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.62,0:15:47.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder where all those angels\Nand warriors ran off to, and why.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.58,0:15:49.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHey, be thankful they're gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.37,0:15:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me, if they see us\Nmaking a run for it
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.50,0:15:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with all the loot we pulled\Nfrom their favorite giant snake,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,well they're not gonna be too thrilled!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami and Conis probably\Nalready have the ship
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.59,0:16:01.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}ready to sail by now, so Robin better\Nhurry and get back here quick! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm hungry, Sanji.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got anything to eat?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. All the food's on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.47,0:16:09.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou've gotta have\Nsomething to munch on, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.09,0:16:11.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Come on, gimme something!\N– [ZORO] I've had enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.01,0:16:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of just sittin' around.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.81,0:16:15.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You guys can wait for her.\NI'm gonna go to the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.23,0:16:17.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.15,0:16:19.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NStupid head!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.52,0:16:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[arguing]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.37,0:16:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hi, hot stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.95,0:16:35.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.42,0:16:38.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've gotta leave!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We stole some gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Look, you moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.55,0:16:46.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right behind her! See them?\NThey can hear you, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.43,0:16:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]\NIt's an army!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.68,0:16:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yells]\NOh, no! Not good! Not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That big thing can only be one thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.16,0:16:57.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.91,0:16:58.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NA cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.94,0:17:03.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just our luck they'd\Nall come back at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRobin! Get the lead out!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.41,0:17:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've gotta get back to the ship now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.83,0:17:11.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Check out this gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.57,0:17:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet we found every\Npiece on the island, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.63,0:17:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From here, it looks like they've\Nalready packed their bags!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.43,0:17:20.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! They're not leaving already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.85,0:17:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.06,0:17:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, great! Here they come!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.39,0:17:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[LUFFY]\NRun!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.55,0:17:29.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's up\Nto me to handle this one.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.07,0:17:33.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop? Stop, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.61,0:17:34.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like hell we'll stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.85,0:17:36.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! You tell 'em, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.29,0:17:41.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We risked life and limb\Nto come to this island
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– in the sky!\N– [LUFFY] Yeah, we did!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then we found the city of gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.28,0:17:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So you think we pirates are leaving\Nempty-handed, you've got another thing coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Capture them? What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing we're trying\Nto do is thank them!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.54,0:17:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LONG MOHAWK]\NUh, Miss, is there a problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and your friends\Nwant this gold, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.59,0:18:01.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess we don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CROWD]\N– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.59,0:18:06.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.46,0:18:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.59,0:18:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[LUFFY]\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI can't turn around!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.35,0:18:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know they're chasing us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]\NZoro, didja see\Nme take care of 'em back there?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.56,0:18:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO laughs]\NYeah! Not bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! Better hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.63,0:18:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\an8}[CROWD]\N– Hey! Come back! Wait!\N– Hey! Come back! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.02,0:18:35.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDon't stop until we reach Cloud End!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.48,0:18:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GROUP]\N– Aye!\N– Aye!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
